-- 2. Span — the beam extends. Ride, comping, and a 3-against-4 woodblock.
-- ~40 cycles (~104 s at 92 BPM).

setbpm 92

d6 bassWalk
xfadeIn 2 12 brush
xfadeIn 3 24 ride
xfadeIn 4 24 compSpan
xfadeIn 5 32 colourSpan

-- implied polymeter: three woodblock hits per cycle against the 4/4 pulse
xfadeIn 9 32 wood3

-- the bass phrase starts stretching over four cycles
xfadeIn 6 16 bassWalk4
